    "number": "Theorem 1.6",
    "quote": "Theorem 1.6 (Instance-dependent regret lower bound). Let (ν, F) be a stationary, unstructured bandit, ρ a risk measure and π a policy. Assume that: (i) ρ is confusable over F ... (ii) π is strongly consistent over F ... In particular, the expected pseudo regret satisfies ... lim inf E[R_T]/log T ⩾ Σ Δ_k / K_inf(ν_k; ρ⋆(ν))."
   },
   "confidence": "medium",
   "notes": "Generalisation of Lai-Robbins/Burnetas-Katehakis to generic risk measures; author presents generality as new. Also gives per-arm pull-count bound 1/Kinf."
